       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.        SPOLIVE.
       AUTHOR.            ANNETTE M. KRAUSS.
       DATE-WRITTEN.      JULY 1986.
      *REMARKS.
      ***********************************************************
      *                     S P O L I V E                       *
      ***********************************************************
      *     THIS SUB PROGRAM LOADS PURCHASE ORDERS, RECEIVING   *
      *     SLIPS, INVOICES FROM THE HISTORY DATA BASE 'STHIST' *
      *     TO THE LIVE DATA BASE 'STORES'.                     *
      ***********************************************************
      *     CALLED FROM:                                        *
      *                       TPOLIVE                           *
      *                                                         *
      ***********************************************************


      *****************************************************************
      **            M O D I F I C A T I O N    H I S T O R Y
      *****************************************************************
      *  12/10/86  MODIFIED PROGRAM TO HANDLE EXPANDED PRICE    *
      *            FIELDS AND ELIMINATION OF DATASETS DPONSITM  *
      *            AND DRQNSITM.                                *
      ***--------------------------------------------------------------
      *   3/10/87  MODIFIED PROGRAM TO HANDLE EXPANDED FIELDS   *
      *            IN DPOFREIGHT AND DINVRCD AND NEW DATA ITEMS *
      *            IN DPORECD, DPOITEM, AND DRCVITEM.           *
      ***--------------------------------------------------------------
      *   1/29/91  MODIFIED PROGRAM TO CHECK FOR DUPLICATE      *
      *       PDR  REGISTER NUMBERS IN THE LIVE DATABASE.  IF   *
      *            DUPLICATES EXIST, THE RECALL IS NOT PERMITTED*
      *            THIS WAS DONE USING THE PORTABILITY CRITERIA.*
      ***--------------------------------------------------------------
      *  02/21/94  JEFF BUNGO   REQ #6449
      *    ADDED NEW FIELDS TO THE HISTORY DATABASES TO MATCH
      *    THE LIVE DATABASES.  CHANGED THIS PROGRAM TO USE
      *    THE NEW HISTORY FIELDS IN MOVING FROM HISTORY TO LIVE.
      ***--------------------------------------------------------------
      *  SEPTEMBER 1996  JE COFFMAN  REQ# 6619                  *
      *    EXPAND DATE FIELDS TO COMPLY TO YEAR 2000.           *
      ***--------------------------------------------------------------
      *  11/22/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *    ADDED LOGIC TO MOVE QS9000 TRACKING FROM HISTORY.
      ***--------------------------------------------------------------
      *  26FEB1997  DAVE PLUM
      *    REVISED TO MOVE ZEROES TO THE ASN QUANTITY FIELD IN
      *    DPOITEM AND DRCVITEM.  THIS NUMERIC FIELD DOES NOT
      *    YET EXIST IN THE HISTORY DATABASE.
      ***--------------------------------------------------------------
      *  03/18/97   CA YODER
      *    FOUND THAT CLASS WAS NOT BEING MOVED FROM DPOITEM WHEN
      *    BROUGHT OVER TO LIVE DATABASE.  CORRECTED PROBLEM.
      ***--------------------------------------------------------------
      *  05/07/97   CA YODER
      *    WHEN THE PO SHIP OR EXPECT DATES WERE ZERO VALUES, THE
      *    VALUE "20" WAS BEING USED FOR THE CENTURY (THE DATES
      *    LOOKED LIKE "20000000").  CORRECTED LOGIC TO MOVE ALL
      *    ZEROES IF THE DATES ARE EQUAL TO ZERO.
      ***--------------------------------------------------------------
      *  08/13/98   CA YODER
      *    THE PAD12 FIELDS WERE NOT ALL BEING MOVED BACK FROM
      *    HISTORY.  ADDED LOGIC TO MOVE THE FIELDS.
      ***--------------------------------------------------------------
DCR01 *  04/02/2003   DAN RAUCH    DCR01
DCR01 *    ADDED LOGIC FOR PO LOGGING
      ***********************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
