PDR    COPY MPLT0   IN COPYLIB.
PDR    COPY MPLTPREG IN COPYLIB.

PDR   ************************************************
PDR   *  HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG = "Y" MEANS THAT THE PORTABILITY PARAGRAPHS
PDR   *  WILL GO TO 2100-BLOWUP IF A BLOWUP OCCURS.  OTHERWISE THE PGM
PDR   *  WILL NEED TO HANDLE BLOWUPS ITSELF.
PDR   ************************************************
PDR    01  HANDLE-BLOWUP-FLAG     PIC X    VALUE "Y".

